{"text":"您那位朋友说也没收到货,会不会是同一批?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"我也不想这样啊,真的,心里也很难过。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["emotion"],"note":""}
{"text":"对不起呀,我刚才讲话没有礼貌。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们会派专人给您送,下午三点前到。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"货在路上,具体到哪我也没法确定。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您说我们不专业,这点我接受。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"我得先查一下仓库的库存再回您。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您好,打扰您了。","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"以后有问题直接找我,不用找客服。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您订单号我记一下,请再说一遍。","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我朋友在海关上班,他说这周查得特别严,所以咱们的货才扣着。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["thirdparty"],"note":""}
{"text":"八五折给您,这是我们的诚意。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":15}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"减一半运费,您看行吗?","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"昨天我们公司聚餐,吃火锅,太辣了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"嗯,好,就这么定了。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"货物迟延是因为天气不好,不是我们的故意。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"weather"}],"tags":["learner","hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"不要紧,我们会负责任的。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您要是现在确认地址,货今天就发。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"这里是客服中心,请问您是哪位?","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"补偿的事我们已经跟您谈过了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["topic-mention"],"note":""}
{"text":"发货已经完成,但是物流信息还没更新。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"哎呀,真的是不好意思,不好意思!","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"喂,这位朋友,您先别挂电话。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"不是我们想拖,是对面仓库一直没回复。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"对不起,货是我们压了,但是现在已经发了。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"三个工作日左右到。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"3_days"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您先别急着退款,我们帮您追一下。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们给您换一个新的,免费。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":null}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您可以发我一个朋友圈截图,我帮您看是不是我们发的。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"好的,您的要求我们收到了,会照办。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"谢谢您信任我们。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"天空这么阴,看样子又要下雨了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"货被扣在海关了,我们也在催,你再等等。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"谁说一定要我们赔的?规定没写这个。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation","quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"啊,我手滑,发错了,请忽略上一条。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"要是您同意换货,我们马上空运。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"抱歉,我们的物流伙伴周末加班的人少。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"不好意思哈,这个月仓库人手不够。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"请问您是想要补发,还是想直接退货?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"您等了这么久,实在辛苦,我们给您补偿二十块。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"说错啦,是周四到,周四!","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"thursday"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们是真的没钱赔,不是小气。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"哎唷,这个真的是不好意思啦,我们会再补寄一次喔。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"},{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":null}],"tags":["dialect","tw"],"note":""}
{"text":"Boss说可以discount九折lah,你满意吗?","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":10}],"tags":["mixed","my"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们那边昨晚才听说海关罢工了。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"customs"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您那个朋友买的是同款吧?他收到了没?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"昨天我去医院看牙,等了三个钟头。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"哇,您说话好有道理,我都想鼓掌了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"如果真的没人签收,快递会放到菜鸟驿站。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hypothetical"],"note":""}
{"text":"咱们说好了,周二发,周四到。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"},{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"thursday"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您的意思是不要补发,要直接退款对吧?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"最多给到九折,再低就亏本了。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":10}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"听您这么说,我心里也不是滋味。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["emotion"],"note":""}
{"text":"请相信我们,我们一直在跟进。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["soothing"],"note":""}
{"text":"我哪敢说是您的错呢,都是我们的问题。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"你要是真的生气,可以打电话给我们老板。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"麻烦把订单截图发过来,我马上查。","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们的责任我们认,绝不推卸。","frames":[{"act":"acknowledge","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"因为疫情封控,发货被延后了一周。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"好的好的,听您的。","frames":[{"act":"agree","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"您方便的话,告诉我您最晚几号要。","frames":[{"act":"ask_deadline","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们这边是不会赔偿的,但是会保证货物完好。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"七折不是不能谈,但要您买满两件。","frames":[{"act":"discount","pol":"+","pct":30}],"tags":["conditional","hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"您说「你们根本没诚意」,我们很想证明有诚意。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"好,谢谢您的反馈,我们记下了。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"你不要凶我嘛,我也是帮你查。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["emotion"],"note":""}
{"text":"加急可以做,可是要看货在哪儿。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"我昨天夜里梦见包裹自己飞过来了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"货昨天没发出去,因为打包的小妹请假。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"other"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"谢谢理解,祝您周末愉快。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"},{"act":"closing","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我跟你讲,这个件我们真的发了,是快递不给力。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"logistics"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"哥,别生气,我给你补发,今天就发。","frames":[{"act":"resend","pol":"+","when":"today"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"您看,要不我们先退一部分钱给您?","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["question"],"note":""}
{"text":"多谢多谢,这次真的辛苦您了。","frames":[{"act":"thanks","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您已经说了三遍要赔,我听明白了。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"抱歉哈,今天只能给您发这个了。","frames":[{"act":"apologize","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"赔不起,真的赔不起。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"周三到不了,最早周四。","frames":[{"act":"promise_time","pol":"+","when":"thursday"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"客人您好,欢迎光临!","frames":[{"act":"greet","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"快递小哥刚刚给我打电话,说马上出发。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["thirdparty"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们没办法再快了,已经是最快的了。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"-"}],"tags":["negation"],"note":""}
{"text":"我这边帮您申请优先出库。","frames":[{"act":"expedite","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"您说不要优惠要现货,可是现货真的没了。","frames":[{"act":"cause","pol":"+","reason":"stock"}],"tags":["quote"],"note":""}
{"text":"嘻嘻,您别吓我,我胆子小。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"九十九块的券,我给您发过去了。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"这个单子的订单编号麻烦您拍照发我。","frames":[{"act":"ask_order","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"我们公司从来不会推卸责任。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["hard"],"note":""}
{"text":"今天我吃了一碗特别难吃的面。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["offtopic"],"note":""}
{"text":"要想早点到,您只能自己去自提点取。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["conditional"],"note":""}
{"text":"您看这样行吗,我们送一个小礼物,算赔礼。","frames":[{"act":"compensate","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
{"text":"好了好了,不说了,我去催仓库。","frames":[{"act":"none","pol":"+"}],"tags":["casual"],"note":""}
{"text":"这个公司规定不允许,真的没办法通融。","frames":[{"act":"refuse","pol":"+"}],"tags":["fluent"],"note":""}
